{"parse":{"title":"The Devil's Wall","pageid":400981,"revid":2149799,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Devil&#39;s Wall</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e8/Constellation_The_Devil%27s_Wall.png/revision/latest?cb=20250912030137\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation The Devil&#39;s Wall\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e8/Constellation_The_Devil%27s_Wall.png/revision/latest?cb=20250912030137\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e8/Constellation_The_Devil%27s_Wall.png/revision/latest?cb=20250912030137 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e8/Constellation_The_Devil%27s_Wall.png/revision/latest?cb=20250912030137 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation The Devil&#39;s Wall\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_The_Devil%27s_Wall.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation The Devil&#39;s Wall.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flins\" title=\"Flins\">Flins</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Part_the_Veil_of_Snow\" title=\"Part the Veil of Snow\">Part the Veil of Snow</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stranger_in_the_Night\" title=\"Stranger in the Night\">Stranger in the Night</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">For the next 6s after using the special Elemental Skill Northland Spearstorm, when Flins's next Normal Attack hits an opponent, it will deal an additional 50% of Flins's <a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a> as <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>AoE Electro DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Charged DMG.<br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b>: While Flins is on the field, after his <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span> attacks hit an opponent, that opponent's <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro <a href=\"/wiki/RES\" title=\"RES\">RES</a></b></span> will be decreased by 25% for 7s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Direct_Lunar-Charged\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Direct Lunar-Charged\">Direct Lunar-Charged</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electro_RES_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Electro RES Reduction\">Electro RES Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign:_Ascendant_Gleam\" title=\"Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam\">Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>The Devil's Wall</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Flins\" title=\"Flins\">Flins</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_2_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 2 Constellation\">Level 2 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced_Properties\">Advanced Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Devil%2527s_Wall%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-secti